{"3570340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "这个CEO我当定了！", "steam_appid": 3570340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4039780], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关注我们的动态</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/df1cd47d360f50ba7d51c8363a6c9ade.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1600 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群①：980802652（已满）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群②：310999329</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏介绍</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >是安稳地在下层度日？还是孤独地冲刺职场顶端？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >是甘心与虎谋皮？还是甘愿向死而生？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/5efe126c983042bde2dbadeed09b0df9.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1920 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《这CEO我当定了！》游戏中，求职并非一片坦途，是机遇也是考验。在这职场的潜规则之中，走错一步就有可能丢掉饭碗，在一次次的选择中度过危机，迈步向前。人生也非常有两全齐美之策，权衡利弊，通过等价交换来稳固地位，是不变的原则。在选择中抓住机遇，把主动权掌握在自己手上，化身游龙，做职场中的主导，利益、情感、名望都并非不可获得。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/f65d1d45cb406a549b964613df8322de.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1920 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏特色</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>在职场“潜规则”中不断前行探索，从底层员工一步步爬起</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/215b188915e3255d4192d64b8699d7fe.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1920 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏主人公将随着玩家的选择来进行活动，你就是故事的主角。在游戏中，将还原PUA、霸凌、小团体等各类职场现状，当你不小心动了资本的蛋糕，是否又能从被做的局里全身而退？你的每一次选择都是十字路口，每一次选择都是一段全新的故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>多样结局，你的选择决定未来走向</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/c208057da5ee11c524831de2352d6599.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1920 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏设计了众多章节，多重的分支剧情，多种的结局故事，让玩家在探索选择中寻找不同故事与结局。在游戏中是选择扩大你的“朋友圈”，还是成为排除异己的独狼？你又是否能够看破被粉饰在华丽表皮地下那锈迹斑斑的真相？或许从来你没有“最正确”的选择，但永远有你“最真实”的决定。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>第一人称进入真实职场，任何时刻不要放弃</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/a79bdd6b9ac7dc3fedea641a1b433a74.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1920 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >第一视角，代入角色，身临其境般的选择。感受在职场生涯中，不仅有利益与生存，还有人性。即便跌入谷底，匹配身边所有资源，权衡利弊，在职场中一步步爬起反击！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>深刻的情感共鸣，职场的爱恨情仇</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/d170e83ba775da0ca3f316965b073a71.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1920 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在游戏、故事中，感受角色，释放情感，深刻的情感参与进入游戏，一波三折的人生故事。职场爱情带来的甜蜜后，能否用来盖住职场里受到的苦？在感情与事业的天平上，你会倾向于在哪一端增添砝码？在职场受到的苦，以牙还牙，加倍奉还吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>角色介绍</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「Joanna」优家科技人力资源总监，热情且知性，积极且主动。职场如此复杂，是只想成为林燃的”知心大姐姐“，还是其中另有目的？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/f696ae79923094a4f803aad296a4225e.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/f696ae79923094a4f803aad296a4225e.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「叶灵溪」优家科技《问天》组实习生，初入职场的新人，灵动乖巧，或许她什么都不懂，也或许她其实什么都懂，对主角林燃似乎有别样的情感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/b03aab87d9b771db85f4c1fa7c240b8e.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/b03aab87d9b771db85f4c1fa7c240b8e.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「叶岚」岚芯工作室CEO，独自运营打理了一家小型工作室，推动林燃入职优家科技，她身上似乎隐藏着一些更深层次的秘密。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/c12decd74d5e8b17dc3427c7ca4042f6.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/c12decd74d5e8b17dc3427c7ca4042f6.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「方桐」优家科技CEO，对林燃未来的发展寄予厚望，虽然坐上了CEO的位置，但优家科技背后似乎拥有更为复杂的利益关系网络。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/5a78bc2cf8046a4599dbc02a71e2c700.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/5a78bc2cf8046a4599dbc02a71e2c700.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「苏酥」娱乐圈新晋小花，一颗冉冉升起的新星，因主角林燃，和优家科技有着深度合作关系和利益绑定，是林燃背后强有力的支持者之一。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/686072835171db37b3cf68d8369a5ed9.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/686072835171db37b3cf68d8369a5ed9.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「夏乐」优家科技“神神秘秘的美工”，在主角升职逆袭路上重要的帮手之一，在她身上，总会引发出一些意想不到的“奇迹”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/a78867767da23da4573f723f3b347bd0.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/a78867767da23da4573f723f3b347bd0.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>关注我们的动态</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/df1cd47d360f50ba7d51c8363a6c9ade.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1600 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群①：980802652（已满）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群②：310999329</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏介绍</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >是安稳地在下层度日？还是孤独地冲刺职场顶端？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >是甘心与虎谋皮？还是甘愿向死而生？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/5efe126c983042bde2dbadeed09b0df9.avif?t=1761037568\" width=1920 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《这CEO我当定了！》游戏中，求职并非一片坦途，是机遇也是考验。在这职场的潜规则之中，走错一步就有可能丢掉饭碗，在一次次的选择中度过危机，迈步向前。人生也非常有两全齐美之策，权衡利弊，通过等价交换来稳固地位，是不变的原则。在选择中抓住机遇，把主动权掌握在自己手上，化身游龙，做职场中的主导，利益、情感、名望都并非不可获得。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_