agraph\" >在游戏、故事中，感受角色，释放情感，深刻的情感参与进入游戏，一波三折的人生故事。职场爱情带来的甜蜜后，能否用来盖住职场里受到的苦？在感情与事业的天平上，你会倾向于在哪一端增添砝码？在职场受到的苦，以牙还牙，加倍奉还吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>角色介绍</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「Joanna」优家科技人力资源总监，热情且知性，积极且主动。职场如此复杂，是只想成为林燃的”知心大姐姐“，还是其中另有目的？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/f696ae79923094a4f803aad296a4225e.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/f696ae79923094a4f803aad296a4225e.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「叶灵溪」优家科技《问天》组实习生，初入职场的新人，灵动乖巧，或许她什么都不懂，也或许她其实什么都懂，对主角林燃似乎有别样的情感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/b03aab87d9b771db85f4c1fa7c240b8e.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/b03aab87d9b771db85f4c1fa7c240b8e.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「叶岚」岚芯工作室CEO，独自运营打理了一家小型工作室，推动林燃入职优家科技，她身上似乎隐藏着一些更深层次的秘密。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/c12decd74d5e8b17dc3427c7ca4042f6.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/c12decd74d5e8b17dc3427c7ca4042f6.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「方桐」优家科技CEO，对林燃未来的发展寄予厚望，虽然坐上了CEO的位置，但优家科技背后似乎拥有更为复杂的利益关系网络。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/5a78bc2cf8046a4599dbc02a71e2c700.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/5a78bc2cf8046a4599dbc02a71e2c700.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「苏酥」娱乐圈新晋小花，一颗冉冉升起的新星，因主角林燃，和优家科技有着深度合作关系和利益绑定，是林燃背后强有力的支持者之一。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/686072835171db37b3cf68d8369a5ed9.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/686072835171db37b3cf68d8369a5ed9.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「夏乐」优家科技“神神秘秘的美工”，在主角升职逆袭路上重要的帮手之一，在她身上，总会引发出一些意想不到的“奇迹”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/a78867767da23da4573f723f3b347bd0.webp?t=1761037568\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/extras/a78867767da23da4573f723f3b347bd0.poster.webp?t=1761037568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=393 /></picture></span></p>", "short_description": "《这个ceo我当定了！》跟随着主人公（林燃）的求职机遇，进入这职场之中的龙争虎斗。财富与名望，就在选择之间，抓住机遇，成就事业。在这暗斗之中，是为利益与虎谋皮？还是无畏恐惧向死而生？这职场ceo我当定了！", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/4c24ce2778550751c60750500d96a36f9d6b307c/header.jpg?t=1761037568", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570340/d61e0d0533d4d8bd725